{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Treat a missing configured base directory as permanent.** `NoSuchFileException` from traversing a missing base-path component reaches this fallback, so `RetrySerDes` repeatedly delays for a pre-provisioning/configuration error, contrary to the documented structural-failure behavior. Distinguish directory-traversal failures from a missing payload file: wrap the former in `SerDesException` while keeping the latter retryable, and update the missing-base test accordingly.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7o3vTN","finding_digest":"2bcf2603b3ee182ca49fe665229af7f411781ad670ee09834d6704a357ee1a07","finding_id":"arf_v1_fphsma5t5ymczje74zssfgxx6q","finding_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::opensecuredirectory::symlink-retry-classification","identity_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::opensecuredirectory::symlink-retry-classification","line":348,"observation_digest":"fcf11b35f136e7917e4464816f5771f71cd25637433a33ba37e7cd88029427d7","observation_id":"aro_v1_7tyrwnprg3tzc7semsaw6v3r64","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/FileSystemSerDes.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_fphsma5t5ymczje74zssfgxx6q","published_at":"2026-09-01T18:03:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_i5zhhrubmeok6ypovf56fipvxg","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"09fbaea9d575b2ff90b22818721f57edda7cec41","reviewer":"codex","start_line":348,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":672},"record_id":"art_v1_yygkc2btv7cyb65rcbyeeqld2p","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T18:03:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
